  "notes": "The Law on Education names the three levels, starts primary at 6 and puts the graduation grades at IX and XI; the State Examination Center calls them 9-year general secondary and 11-year complete secondary. The law leaves level durations to the executive: Cabinet of Ministers Decision No. 212 of 22 June 2020 sets primary as grades I–IV, general secondary as V–IX and complete secondary as X–XI."
